Artwork
  The app icon, splash screen and login image (assets/, and
  mothership-server/public/login-hero.jpg) were generated with an AI image
  tool for this project.

Map data
  assets/maps/default.mbtiles and any map pack built with tools/map-pack
  contain data from OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, made
  available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
  https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
  The tiles are extracted from Protomaps builds of that data and drawn with
  styles generated by the Protomaps basemaps project (BSD 3-Clause).
  https://protomaps.com  https://github.com/protomaps/basemaps
  The app shows the attribution "(c) OpenStreetMap contributors, Protomaps"
  on the map. Keep it if you redistribute the app or the packs.

Map fonts
  assets/maps/fonts contains glyphs from the Noto Sans fonts, Copyright 2022
  The Noto Project Authors, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The full
  licence is in assets/maps/fonts/OFL.txt and must stay with the font files.
  https://openfontlicense.org  https://github.com/notofonts

Online map tiles
  With an internet connection the app shows tiles from OpenStreetMap's tile
  servers, under the OpenStreetMap tile usage policy.
  https://operations.osmfoundation.org/policies/tiles/

Cryptography
  @noble/curves, @noble/ciphers, @noble/hashes, (c) Paul Miller, MIT License.

Google Nearby Connections
  The Android app uses Google Nearby Connections through the
  play-services-nearby client library, which the build downloads. It is not
  open source and is not included in this repository. Its use is subject to
  Google's APIs Terms of Service. https://developers.google.com/terms

Other dependencies
  The app and server use React Native, Expo, MapLibre, Express and other open
  source packages, installed by npm under their own licences. See each
  package's licence in node_modules after "npm install".
